			"Message": "refactor(Common): Rename crate to CommonLibrary and centralize lint configuration\n\nThe crate name has been changed from `Common` to `CommonLibrary` in `Cargo.toml` to ensure distinct naming within the `Land` ecosystem and avoid potential conflicts with dependency crates. The README documentation has been updated to reflect the new import path.\n\nTo improve maintainability and reduce boilerplate, all `#![allow(...)]` linter directives have been removed from individual module files (`mod.rs`) and consolidated into the root `Source/Library.rs`. This standardizes style enforcement across the abstract core.\n\nThis commit also expands the architectural contracts:\n- Extended `TreeViewProvider` with state management methods (`OnTreeNodeExpanded`, `OnTreeSelectionChanged`, `PersistTreeViewState`, `RestoreTreeViewState`). This enables `Mountain` to implement persistent UI state for the `Sky` layer's tree views.\n- Added `TestRunNotFound` to `CommonError` for enhanced error handling in the testing framework.\n- Configured the Windows subsystem attribute in the library root for proper GUI compilation.\n- Bumped the `@cloudflare/workers-types` dev dependency.\n\n**BREAKING CHANGE:** Downstream crates (`Mountain`, `Cocoon`, etc.) must update their `Cargo.toml` dependencies and import paths from `Common` to `CommonLibrary`.",
			"SHA": "e84a0d13477d10f6db6e74d502e1243bad87134a"
		}
